        ],
        [
          68.0,
          758.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "47. What do we learn about solidarity in an increasingly diverse society?\nA) It gives rise to a complicated division of labour.\nB) It involves many aspects with great complexity.\nC) It brings individuals together as environment changes.\nD) It embraces the characteristics of different individuals",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        764,
        687,
        914
      ],
      "block_id": 5,
      "block_order": 6,
      "group_id": 5,
      "block_polygon_points": [
