    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "48. What would we witness in the setting of communitarianism?\nA) Ruling of social norms and ridding of individuality.\nB) Emphasis on the adherence to individual differences.\nC) Sacrifice of personal interests for the common good.\nD) Elimination of individualism and personal choices.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        920,
        616,
        1069
      ],
      "block_id": 6,
      "block_order": 7,
      "group_id": 6,
      "block_polygon_points": [
