      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "49. What does solidarity entail according to the passage?\nA) A limit to personal differences. C) A hindrance to social advancement.\nB) An opposition to individualism. D) An inevitable end to liberal pursuits.",
