    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "50. What do social theorists think of solidarity?\nA) It is especially relevant to the most vulnerable. C) It is essential to progress and order in society.\nB) It is most effective in protecting human dignity. D) It is indispensable to avoiding shallow relationships",
